'' RUN: std/fs phase P2 -- the Stream contract against MemoryStream (short reads, Ok( 0 ) at
'' the end, bad arguments, Seek's rules, the zero-filled gap, ReadExact, ReadToEnd
'' appending); a stream defined outside the module overriding the protected hooks one byte
'' per call, through ReadExact, WriteAll and Copy; the base Stream's FS_UNSUPPORTED;
'' MemoryStream as a value; and ToUtf8Text agreeing with ReadAllText on a corpus of BOMs,
'' invalid UTF-8, odd UTF-16 and lone surrogates.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/fs-p2.tiko -o tests/codegen/fsp2.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/fsp2.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/fsp2.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
